{"id":"n15398-1-10","stage":3,"title":"가입자 · 用户","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15398-1-10-1","ko":"건강 보험에 들려고 하는데 어느 회사가 좋을까?","zh":"我打算办健康保险，不知道选哪家比较好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"건강","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}},{"text":"보험에","meaning":"保险","explanation":"보험：保险；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"보험","audio":"/audio/483b66ad0cc4f7d5acd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59682","senseId":"1","lemma":"보험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보험에","audio":"/audio/b1677e1287b8f85c62e0.mp3"}},{"text":"들려고","meaning":"入，投，加入","explanation":"들다：入，投，加入；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"15","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들려고","audio":"/audio/2c87680cbf9f5d92e306.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"어느","meaning":"哪，哪个","explanation":"어느：哪，哪个","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"3","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}},{"text":"회사가","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사가","audio":"/audio/b96455c57e5cb7549f00.mp3"}},{"text":"좋을까?","meaning":"好，强","explanation":"좋다：好，强；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"15","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋을까","audio":"/audio/2522a45a86bca3387290.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"483b66ad0cc4f7d5","term":"보험","zh":"保险","audio":"/audio/483b66ad0cc4f7d5acd1.mp3","entryId":"59682","definition":"为在未来发生灾害或疾病等时得到金钱上的补偿而在规定的时间内缴纳一定金额的钱进行积累的制度。","pronunciation":["보ː험"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"入，投，加入","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"存钱或买保险等。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"哪，哪个","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"不管任何人或物。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，强","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"和别的相比，质量或水平等更高。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/612d6a3c0ac0e03800d8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15398-1-10-2","ko":"아무래도 가입자 수가 많은 곳이 낫겠지.","zh":"我觉得参保人数多的公司会更好吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}},{"text":"가입자","meaning":"用户，会员","explanation":"가입자：用户，会员","readings":[{"term":"가입자","audio":"/audio/4fe49b0a7c2ab66dd89d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15398","senseId":"1","lemma":"가입자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가입자","audio":"/audio/4fe49b0a7c2ab66dd89d.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"곳이","meaning":"处，地方","explanation":"곳：处，地方；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"2","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳이","audio":"/audio/425fee6379fd1e4146b7.mp3"}},{"text":"낫겠지.","meaning":"更好，胜过","explanation":"낫다：更好，胜过；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"낫다","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38524","senseId":"1","lemma":"낫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낫겠지","audio":"/audio/6f42f064c9311b4ff3ab.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f5dbee1c946c5e6b","term":"아무래도","zh":"到底，还是","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3","entryId":"71330","definition":"不管怎么想；或指不管怎么做。","pronunciation":["아ː무래도"]},{"id":"4fe49b0a7c2ab66d","term":"가입자","zh":"用户，会员","audio":"/audio/4fe49b0a7c2ab66dd89d.mp3","entryId":"15398","definition":"进入某个团体或组织的人，或者签订商品及服务协议的人。","pronunciation":["가입짜"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"处，地方","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"抽象的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"fde5eb6648ee9db9","term":"낫다","zh":"更好，胜过","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3","entryId":"38524","definition":"相比之下，比别的好。","pronunciation":["낟ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4931789d36724241ab2b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15398","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得参保人数多的公司会更好吧。","我打算办健康保险，不知道选哪家比较好？","哇，这种资料是在哪儿能找到的啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我打算办健康保险，不知道选哪家比较好？","哇，这种资料是在哪儿能找到的啊？","我觉得参保人数多的公司会更好吧。"],"answer":2}]}
